WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.598
Dr Petra Umbile is a Postdoctoral Fellow at Slop University.

00:00:07.198 --> 00:00:09.148
I trained to count citations.

00:00:09.448 --> 00:00:11.558
Now I study the work a count leaves out.

00:00:12.158 --> 00:00:14.888
A volunteer whose name never made the honour board.

00:00:15.188 --> 00:00:18.168
The note on the fridge that the booking form doesn't ask for.

00:00:18.468 --> 00:00:21.518
The conversation in a performance review that nobody scores.

00:00:22.318 --> 00:00:25.893
Researchers in every school of the University cite her work.

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:28.523
Nine hundred and twenty-five citations.

00:00:28.823 --> 00:00:30.013
Thirty-four co-authors.

00:00:30.313 --> 00:00:32.553
And an h-index of twenty-six,

00:00:32.753 --> 00:00:34.503
the second-highest in her school.

00:00:35.503 --> 00:00:37.873
A count is only ever part of the record.

00:00:38.173 --> 00:00:39.293
I go and find the rest.

00:00:40.093 --> 00:00:41.343
Our website has all her work.

00:00:41.493 --> 00:00:42.623
Follow us on Bluesky,

00:00:42.773 --> 00:00:43.663
or drop us an email.
